    {
      "id": "es-u03-l2",
      "title": "Eleven to twenty",
      "notes": "**11-15** are one-off words to learn: **once, doce, trece, catorce, quince**.\nFrom **16** the pattern is 'ten and six' run together: **dieci + seis = dieciséis**, then **diecisiete, dieciocho, diecinueve**. (The z of diez turns to c, and dieciséis needs an accent to keep the stress on the end.)\nThen **veinte** (20).\nTake away with **menos** (minus, less): **Veinte menos cinco son quince.**",
      "items": [
        {"es": "once", "en": "eleven", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["11"]},
        {"es": "doce", "en": "twelve", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["12"]},
        {"es": "trece", "en": "thirteen", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["13"]},
        {"es": "catorce", "en": "fourteen", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["14"]},
        {"es": "quince", "en": "fifteen", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["15"]},
        {"es": "dieciséis", "en": "sixteen", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["16"]},
        {"es": "diecisiete", "en": "seventeen", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["17"]},
        {"es": "dieciocho", "en": "eighteen", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["18"]},
        {"es": "diecinueve", "en": "nineteen", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["19"]},
        {"es": "veinte", "en": "twenty", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["20"]},
        {"es": "menos", "en": "minus", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["less"]}
      ],
      "sentences": [
        {"es": "Diez y uno son once.", "en": "Ten and one are eleven.", "focus": "once", "accept_en": ["Ten plus one is eleven.", "Ten and one make eleven."]},
        {"es": "Veinte menos cinco son quince.", "en": "Twenty minus five is fifteen.", "focus": "quince", "accept_en": ["Twenty minus five are fifteen.", "Twenty less five is fifteen."]},
        {"es": "Doce y ocho son veinte.", "en": "Twelve and eight are twenty.", "focus": "veinte", "accept_en": ["Twelve plus eight is twenty.", "Twelve and eight make twenty."]},
        {"es": "Trece, catorce, quince.", "en": "Thirteen, fourteen, fifteen.", "focus": "catorce", "accept_en": ["13, 14, 15."]},
        {"es": "Diecinueve menos tres son dieciséis.", "en": "Nineteen minus three is sixteen.", "focus": "dieciséis", "accept_en": ["Nineteen minus three are sixteen."]},
        {"es": "Nueve y nueve son dieciocho.", "en": "Nine and nine are eighteen.", "focus": "dieciocho", "accept_en": ["Nine plus nine is eighteen.", "Nine and nine make eighteen."]},
        {"es": "Diez y siete son diecisiete.", "en": "Ten and seven are seventeen.", "focus": "diecisiete", "accept_en": ["Ten plus seven is seventeen.", "Ten and seven make seventeen."]},
        {"es": "Catorce menos dos son doce.", "en": "Fourteen minus two is twelve.", "focus": "menos", "accept_en": ["Fourteen minus two are twelve."]},
        {"es": "Diez y tres son trece.", "en": "Ten and three are thirteen.", "focus": "trece", "accept_en": ["Ten plus three is thirteen.", "Ten and three make thirteen."]},
        {"es": "Veinte menos uno son diecinueve.", "en": "Twenty minus one is nineteen.", "focus": "diecinueve", "accept_en": ["Twenty minus one are nineteen."]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "es-u03-l3",
      "title": "How old are you?",
      "notes": "In Spanish you don't 'be' an age, you **have** it: **Tengo treinta años** = 'I have thirty years'. Saying 'soy treinta' is a classic beginner slip.\nThe verb is **tener** (to have):\n**yo** tengo · **tú** tienes · **él / ella / usted** tiene\nThe question: **¿Cuántos años tienes?** (how many years do you have?) - or **¿Cuántos años tiene?** for usted.\nTwo tens to start with: **treinta** (30) and **cuarenta** (40). And watch the ñ: **años** is years; without the tilde it's a very different word.",
      "items": [
        {"es": "tener", "en": "to have", "kind": "verb"},
        {"es": "tengo", "en": "I have", "kind": "phrase"},
        {"es": "tienes", "en": "you have (informal)", "kind": "phrase", "accept_en": ["you have"]},
        {"es": "tiene", "en": "he / she has, you have (formal)", "kind": "phrase", "accept_en": ["he has", "she has", "it has", "you have"]},
        {"es": "¿cuántos años tienes?", "en": "how old are you?", "kind": "phrase", "accept": ["¿cuántos años tiene?"]},
        {"es": "el año", "en": "the year", "kind": "word", "gender": "m", "accept_en": ["year"]},
        {"es": "el niño", "en": "the boy", "kind": "word", "gender": "m", "accept_en": ["the child", "the kid", "boy"]},
        {"es": "la niña", "en": "the girl", "kind": "word", "gender": "f", "accept_en": ["the child", "the kid", "girl"]},
        {"es": "el perro", "en": "the dog", "kind": "word", "gender": "m", "accept_en": ["dog"]},
        {"es": "el gato", "en": "the cat", "kind": "word", "gender": "m", "accept_en": ["cat"]},
        {"es": "treinta", "en": "thirty", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["30"]},
        {"es": "cuarenta", "en": "forty", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["40"]}
      ],
      "sentences": [
        {"es": "¿Cuántos años tienes?", "en": "How old are you?", "focus": "años"},
        {"es": "Tengo treinta años.", "en": "I'm thirty years old.", "focus": "Tengo", "accept_en": ["I'm thirty.", "I am thirty years old.", "I am 30."]},
        {"es": "Ana tiene cuarenta años.", "en": "Ana is forty years old.", "focus": "cuarenta", "accept_en": ["Ana is forty.", "Ana is 40."]},
        {"es": "El niño tiene ocho años.", "en": "The boy is eight years old.", "focus": "niño", "accept_en": ["The boy is eight.", "The child is eight."]},
        {"es": "La niña tiene seis años.", "en": "The girl is six years old.", "focus": "niña", "accept_en": ["The girl is six."]},
        {"es": "El perro tiene doce años.", "en": "The dog is twelve years old.", "focus": "perro", "accept_en": ["The dog is twelve."]},
        {"es": "El gato tiene tres años.", "en": "The cat is three years old.", "focus": "gato", "accept_en": ["The cat is three."]},
        {"es": "Y usted, ¿cuántos años tiene?", "en": "And you, how old are you?", "focus": "tiene", "accept_en": ["And how old are you?"]},
        {"es": "Yo tengo cuarenta años, ¿y tú?", "en": "I'm forty, and you?", "focus": "cuarenta", "accept_en": ["I'm forty years old, and you?", "I am forty, what about you?"]},
        {"es": "Carlos tiene treinta años.", "en": "Carlos is thirty.", "focus": "treinta", "accept_en": ["Carlos is thirty years old."]},
        {"es": "¿Tienes diecinueve años?", "en": "Are you nineteen?", "focus": "Tienes", "accept_en": ["Are you nineteen years old?"]}
      ]
