    {
      "id": "es-u03-l4",
      "title": "Phone numbers and hay",
      "notes": "**Hay** (said 'eye') means both 'there is' and 'there are' - one word, never changes: **Hay un perro**, **Hay veinte estudiantes**. Ask how many with **¿Cuántos...?**: **¿Cuántos niños hay?**\nPhone numbers are usually read in pairs in Latin America (cero cuatro, doce...), but digit by digit is always understood.\n**Mi** = my, **tu** = your (no accent - **tú** with one is 'you'). Unit 7 has the rest.\n**El celular** is the mobile phone in Latin America; in Spain it's **el móvil**.\nPlurals preview: **los estudiantes**, **los niños** - 'the' becomes **los** and the noun adds -s. A boys-and-girls group is **niños** too.",
      "items": [
        {"es": "hay", "en": "there is / there are", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["there is", "there are", "there's"]},
        {"es": "¿cuántos?", "en": "how many?", "kind": "word", "accept": ["¿cuántas?"]},
        {"es": "el teléfono", "en": "the phone", "kind": "word", "gender": "m", "accept_en": ["the telephone", "phone"]},
        {"es": "el celular", "en": "the mobile phone", "kind": "word", "gender": "m", "accept": ["el móvil"], "accept_en": ["the mobile", "the cell phone", "the cellphone", "mobile"], "note": "Spain: el móvil."},
        {"es": "¿cuál es tu número?", "en": "what's your number?", "kind": "phrase", "accept_en": ["what is your number?"]},
        {"es": "mi", "en": "my", "kind": "word"},
        {"es": "tu", "en": "your", "kind": "word", "note": "No accent - 'tú' with one is 'you'."},
        {"es": "la clase", "en": "the class", "kind": "word", "gender": "f", "accept_en": ["the lesson", "class"]},
        {"es": "en", "en": "in", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["on", "at"]},
        {"es": "los estudiantes", "en": "the students", "kind": "word", "gender": "m", "accept_en": ["students"]},
        {"es": "los niños", "en": "the children", "kind": "word", "gender": "m", "accept_en": ["the kids", "the boys", "children", "kids"]}
      ],
      "sentences": [
        {"es": "¿Cuál es tu número de teléfono?", "en": "What's your phone number?", "focus": "teléfono", "accept_en": ["What is your phone number?", "What's your telephone number?"]},
